        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Instant Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a new run in seconds and get ready for <strong>intense post-apocalyptic warfare</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with a simple rifle loaded with ammo and some health points… and you’ll face your first enemy almost immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you clear a level:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Loot a new weapon (skip it or equip it)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Gain money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Choose a stat upgrade</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: the next level is always tougher — more enemies, more health, more danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Loot, Loot, Loot!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols, rifles, shotguns, flamethrowers, grenades… and more — each weapon is available in 5 quality tiers.<br>Be fast, be accurate, don’t lose HP — the loot will reward your skill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your money on core stats boosts, support stats… or save your gains for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any good roguelike, you won’t start from scratch every time: upgrade your stats, unlock new lootable weapons and abilities, and grow stronger with every attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Classes, Perks &amp; Mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poly Frenzy features 5 unique classes, each with their own dedicated <strong>progression tree</strong> and <strong>perks</strong>.<br>The more you play a class, the more powerful it becomes — try them all and discover your favorite playstyle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 10 Maps, 2 Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 10 different maps in two solo modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong> — Beat all 10 escalating challenges to climb the leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong> — Pick a map and survive wave after wave… until death.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤜🤛 Solo or Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is tough in solo… and even tougher in coop.<br>Play with friends and test the limits of your friendship — because loot is unique and money is shared!<br>Want to troll? Blow the squad’s hard-earned money on a giant nuke… just to obliterate the very last enemy for nothing. 💣</p>",
